.\" Process this file with: groff -man -Tlatin1 foo.1
.\" Please report any issue with this man page at
.\" https://github.com/Rokk001/Moreya/issues
.TH MOREYA 6 "November 2026" Linux
.SH NAME
Moreya \- real-time strategy game in an underground dungeon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B moreya
.SH DESCRIPTION
Moreya is an open source real-time strategy game set underground. As the
keeper of a dungeon you dig, claim and mine, build rooms, traps and doors,
attract creatures and lead them into battle by dropping them where they are
needed, casting spells and luring enemies into traps. In the campaign the
guilds raid your dungeon through the Moreya gate.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-help
Shows the version and the list of command-line options.
.SH FILES
~/.config/moreya/
.RS
User-specific configuration files. At the first start the configuration
folder of older versions is copied here if it exists.
.RE
~/.local/share/moreya/
.RS
Holds logs (moreya.log and CEGUI.log), saved games, screenshots and replays.
At the first start the data folder of older versions is copied here if it
exists.
.RE
@OD_DATA_PATH@/
.RS
Arch-independent game data files
.RE
@OD_SHARE_PATH@/doc/moreya/
.RS
Additional documentation files
.RE
.SH BUGS
If you encounter a bug, please report it at
\fIhttps://github.com/Rokk001/Moreya/issues\fR.
.SH AUTHOR
This man page was first written by Rémi Verschelde <remi@verschelde.fr> for
OpenDungeons, the game Moreya is based on, and adapted for Moreya.
